 "note": "คีย์ชนิดข้อมูล/ไฟล์ที่ไม่เคยแปลเป็นอังกฤษถูกตัดออกแล้ว — แปลเฉพาะคีย์ในไฟล์นี้ · ลำดับคีย์คือลำดับใน worklist",
 "strings": {
  "All right, I'm off!": "",
  "Ah, hello again. Were you able to make the delivery to Kankichi-san?": "",
  "I was. Here's the money he paid me.": "",
  "What? No, I can't take that, kind samurai. You earned it on your own.": "",
  "If you insist. So, how'd things go for you?": "",
  "Well, I haven't finished just yet...": "",
  "*sigh* I tried, I really did.": "",
  "(Hm. Well, doing one wasn't so bad. I could help him out again.)": "",
  "Don't worry. Give me what you have left, and I'll take care of it when I can.": "",
  "You'll really make more deliveries for me? Kind samurai, thank you so much!": "",
  "Where's the next one going?": "",
  "North Umekojicho, to Yakichi-san.": "",
  "Yakichi in North Umekojicho. Got it.": "",
  "Thank you again! You can keep the fee for this one too, of course.": "",
  "Well then, I'll be off too.": "",
  "When you're finished, come back here and I'll find you another parcel.": "",
  "Thank you, kind samurai!": "",
  "Kind samurai! Thanks for helping out.": "",
  "It's all right. Any more deliveries to make?": "",
  "Let's see, this delivery's going to, uhh...": "",
  "North Fushimi Ichibangai...": "",
  "Yashikimachi...": "",
  "Sannocho...": "",
  "Umekojicho...": "",
  "Says by the riverside in Mukurogai...": "",
  "Says the second floor of Mukurogai...": "",
  "Kawaramachi in Rakunai...": "",
  "It's marked for somewhere out front of Ginryu Dojo in Rakunai...": "",
  "Please take it to Tome-san.": "",
  "Please take it to Ofuka-san.": "",
  "Please take it to Yoshiko-san.": "",
  "Please take it to Kimi-san.": "",
  "Please take it to Tae-san.": "",
  "Please take it to Hana-san.": "",
  "Please take it to Sankichi-san.": "",
  "Please take it to Keisuke-san.": "",
  "Please take it to Gennosuke-san.": "",
  "Please take it Hatsutaro-san.": "",
  "Please take it to Tsuguemon.": "",
  "Please take it to Yunosuke-san.": "",
  "Please take it to Kyuzo-san.": "",
  "Please take it to Dansaburo-san.": "",
  "Please take it to Sadakichi-san.": "",
  "Received <Color:8>Courier's Parcel<Color:Default>.": "",
  "Thank you, and good luck.": "",
  "Sorry, remind me who I'm taking this one to?": "",
  "In front of Ginryu Dojo in Rakunai...": "",
  "Take it to Tome-san.": "",
  "Take it to Ofuka-san.": "",
  "Take it to Yoshiko-san.": "",
  "Take it to Kimi-san.": "",
  "Take it to Tae-san.": "",
  "Take it to Hana-san.": "",
  "Take it to Sankichi-san.": "",
  "Take it to Keisuke-san.": "",
  "Take it to Gennosuke-san.": "",
  "Take it to Hatsutaro-san.": "",
  "Take it to Tsuguemon.": "",
  "Take it to Yunosuke-san.": "",
  "Take it to Kyuzo-san.": "",
  "Take it to Dansaburo-san.": "",
  "Take it to Sadakichi-san.": "",
  "So, what's next?": "",
  "Oh, kind samurai, we're all done for today! I took care of the rest myself!": "",
  "No kidding? Good work.": "",
  "It's all thanks to you. You've made so many deliveries for us, word-of-mouth has improved, and we're getting all the more jobs!": "",
  "I'm glad to hear that. How's your father doing, by the way?": "",
  "He's better, but it'll still be some time before he's back to work.": "",
  "So, I'm sorry to ask, but do you think you could keep helping me out? Just until Dad's on his feet again?": "",
  "Well, we've come this far. I'll help when I can.": "",
  "No problem. Take care, I'll come by again later.": "",
  "There'll be more work waiting for you then!": "",
  "Oh! Hello there!": "",
  "Is that your father? I'm glad to see he's back on his feet.": "",
  "Yes! Dad, this is the man who's been kind enough to help me out.": "",
  "I've heard a lot about you. You've been a great help to my family.": "",
  "It wasn't much. Things have only gone so well because your son became a great courier when he had to.": "",
  "Aw, hell. If not for you, I might have had to give up entirely.": "",
  "I can't thank you enough, kind samurai.": "",
  "Hm. If you say so, but you're standing taller than you ever did before.": "",
  "Well said. My son really has grown up.": "",
  "As a matter of fact, I think he's ready to cover this whole area on his own.": "",
  "Heh. Think you're up for it?": "",
  "I'm nervous... but I'll do my best!": "",
  "In that case, I'd appreciate it if you could still help him out, when you have the chance.": "",
  "Mm...": "",
  "Of course, that's an official request from the head of our family business.": "",
  "So, you can expect much better compensation. What do you say?": "",
  "All right, I could always use some extra coin. I'll pitch in.": "",
  "Really!? That's a relief!": "",
  "You have my thanks, samurai.": "",
  "With your help, I'm sure that someday I can become every bit the courier my father is. Thank you.": "",
  "Are you Kankichi-san?": "",
  "That's me. Who are you?": "",
  "I'm filling in for the courier. Here, delivery for you.": "",
  "Handed over <Color:8>Courier's Parcel<Color:Default>.": "",
  "Ah, thanks for coming all this way.": "",
  "Obtained <Color:8>5000 mon<Color:Default>.": "",
  "(I should let the courier know I took care of it. We're meeting near Teradaya in Fushimi.)": "",
  "Are you Yakichi-san?": "",
  "Package for you.": "",
  "Ah, there it is. Here's your fee.": "",
  "Obtained <Color:8>6000 mon<Color:Default>.": "",
  "Are you Tome-san?": "",
  "I have a package for you.": "",
  "Thank you. Here's your payment.": "",
  "Are you Ofuka-san?": "",
  "Ah, great. And this is for you.": "",
  "Yoshiko-san?": "",
  "Much appreciated. Here's your pay.": "",
  "Excuse me, Kimi-san?": "",
  "Hey, thanks. Here's the payment.": "",
  "Are you Tae-san?": "",
  "Excellent. Got your payment right here.": "",
  "Hana-san, right?": "",
  "Right on time. Thanks so much.": "",
  "Are you Sankichi?": "",
  "Excellent. Much obliged.": "",
  "You're Keisuke, right?": "",
  "Hey, all right. And your pay.": "",
  "Are you Gennosuke?": "",
  "Thanks a ton. This is for you.": "",
  "Hatsutaro, right?": "",
  "Fancy that. Here's your pay.": "",
  "Are you Tsuguemon?": "",
  "Ah, I've been waiting. Thanks.": "",
  "Are you Yunosuke?": "",
  "Thank you. Right, here's your payment.": "",
  "You're Kyuzo, right?": "",
  "That's me. Much appreciated.": "",
  "Dansaburo?": "",
  "Thank you kindly. This is for you.": "",
  "Are you Sadakichi?": "",
  "So you do! Many thanks.": "",
  "Obtained <Color:8>8000 mon<Color:Default>.": "",
  "Obtained <Color:8>7000 mon<Color:Default>.": "",
  "Obtained <Color:8>1 ryo<Color:Default>.": "",
  "Obtained <Color:8>7500 mon<Color:Default>.": "",
  "Obtained <Color:8>1 ryo and 2000 mon<Color:Default>.": "",
  "Obtained <Color:8>1 ryo and 5000 mon<Color:Default>.": "",
  "Obtained <Color:8>9000 mon<Color:Default>.": "",
  "Guess that's it, then.": "",
  "Yo. I've got a Crimson Bead.": "",
  "How about... twenty Water God Stones?": "",
  "Oh. Okay.": "",
  "I thought I said twenty Water God Stones. Maybe you didn't hear me.": "",
  "Obtained <Color:8>Crimson Bead<Color:Default>.": "",
  "That's fine. Thank you.": "",
  "Hey. Nice to see you, Saito-san. If you're interested, I've got a Fine Horse's Mane.": "",
  "I'll trade it to you for a Pearl. 'Course, it's no big deal if you'd rather not.": "",
  "Haven't got a pearl on you? Okay, well, come back when you do.": "",
  "Handed over <Color:8>Pearl<Color:Default>.": "",
  "Obtained <Color:8>Fine Horse's Mane<Color:Default>.": "",
  "Looks like we've got a deal! Thanks for taking the time to trade, even with a pushover like me.": "",
  "I've prepared five Wild Silks.": "",
  "I'll take a Pearl in return.": "",
  "Whatever.": "",
  "Haven't got a pearl? Guess you'll have to find one.": "",
  "Obtained <Color:8>Wild Silk<Color:Default>.": "",
  "That'll do. I've got more Wild Silks, if you want.": "",
  "You the guy? I've got ten Beautiful Pelts on me.": "",
  "I'll let you have them for a Pearl.": "",
  "Hey, that's no pearl! Are you trying to swindle me!? I'm onto you, boss's friend or not!": "",
  "Obtained <Color:8>Beautiful Pelt<Color:Default>.": "",
  "All right, deal's done. Now back away, slowly, and we'll be good.": "",
  "Yo! How are you doing today, Saito-san? I've got some Beast's Tail here! How about it? You want to trade with me? It's real good stuff!": "",
  "I'd love a Pearl for them! That sound good to you? My three Beast's Tail for a Pearl? That seems fair to me!": "",
  "Okay! I mean, I'm disappointed, but maybe another time?": "",
  "Guess you don't have any on you, huh? Well, if you come into a Pearl or two, you know where to find me! I'm always up for a good deal!": "",
  "Obtained <Color:8>Beast's Tail<Color:Default>.": "",
  "Hey, what fun that was! Thanks for the trade, Saito-san! I've still got some more if you find yourself with another Pearl!": "",
  "Hey there! Boss said to trade with you freely. I've got a Fine Silk Fabric, myself.": "",
  "I'm hoping for ten Water God Stones. How about that?": "",
  "No problem! Let me know if you change your mind.": "",
  "That doesn't seem to be enough. Come back with ten Water God Stones, would you?": "",
  "That seals the deal! Let me know if you'd like any more in the future.": "",
  "Hmm. Something's happening at Shikokuya. I should hold off for now.": "",
  "Heheh. Come back later. I'd like to avoid a mess.": "",
  "I've been waiting for you. Are you ready to go?": "",
  "(What should I do?)": "",
  "Sorry, could you hold on a bit longer?": "",
  "I suppose, but do hurry.": "",
  "So, you need an escort to the mansion near Shikokuya?": "",
  "Yes. We'll head toward Shikokuya from here. You'll see it once we reach Rakunai.": "",
  "Right, got it.": "",
  "Saito-san, I've caused you far too much trouble. The Jozo Tengu will reform from here on—consider us an arm of the Tachibanagumi!": "",
  "I look forward to working with you, hahaha!": "",
  "Thank you for all your help, Saito-san.": "",
  "The Touken Clan will be proud to serve the Tachibanagumi. Our cursed blades are at your disposal!": "",
  "Saito-san, thank you. Oharu, my sister, is doing well once again.": "",
  "If you or the Tachibanagumi ever need anything from me, it would be my honor.": "",
  "Y-You saved my life. Thank you.": "",
  "I'm just doing what's right.": "",
  "(Mission complete. I can head back to the barracks now.)": "",
  "Saito-san! It's Katsura! Katsura Kogoro's just down there!": "",
  "Took ya long enough. C'mon, let's move!": "",
  "Captain Saito... Katsura has to be somewhere on this floor. Please... find him.": "",
  "Katsura is behind the sliding door... The one with the sakura storm painted on it. Please... take him down, Captain...": "",
  "Th-Thank you for saving me.": "",
  "You're welcome, I'm just glad to see you safe.": "",
  "(Mission complete! Guess I can head back to the barracks now.)": "",
  "Th-Thank you so much for helping me.": "",
  "Don't worry about it, I just want to see you safe.": "",
  "Thank you, you're my hero!": "",
  "No need for that, just making sure you're safe.": "",
  "S-Saito-san... Katsura is... He's too much for us to handle...": "",
  "Leave me! You have to catch him!": "",
  "But don't feel any pressure to prove yourself. Your reputation has been excellent ever since you captured Izo.": "",
  "Make sure to grab a bite before you go. I assume you have a favorite restaurant.": "",
  "I've got a favorite place myself. They have this unique cold noodle dish called reimen.": "",
  "It's not often forty shishi are in one place. That's a real opportunity for the Shinsengumi to make a name for itself.": "",
  "Be ready. You'll need plenty of stamina for this.": "",
  "いて！": "",
  "Way to go, Saito-san! You're the number one mahjong player in the entire city!": "",
  "Buuut, that means you're gonna have to defend your title from here on.": "",
  "I have to play to keep my title?": ""
 },
 "ref_ja": {
  "All right, I'm off!": "では、行ってきます！",
  "Ah, hello again. Were you able to make the delivery to Kankichi-san?": "お疲れ様です。\r\n勘吉さんには届けてもらえましたか？",
  "I was. Here's the money he paid me.": "ああ、しっかり届けた。\r\nこれは代金だ。",
  "What? No, I can't take that, kind samurai. You earned it on your own.": "いや、それは受け取れません。お侍さんが\r\n届けてくださった分ですので。お礼の替わりだと\r\n思って、取っておいてください。",
  "If you insist. So, how'd things go for you?": "……わかった。\r\nそれでお前のほうは？",
  "Well, I haven't finished just yet...": "それが、まだ終わってなくて……",
  "*sigh* I tried, I really did.": "はい……　はぁぁ、どうしよう……",
  "(Hm. Well, doing one wasn't so bad. I could help him out again.)": "（……大分困っているようだな。\r\n　乗りかかった船だ、手伝ってやるか）",
  "Don't worry. Give me what you have left, and I'll take care of it when I can.": "仕方ない。……街を行き来することは多いからな。\r\nそのついでで良ければ、手伝ってやろう。",
  "You'll really make more deliveries for me? Kind samurai, thank you so much!": "ほ、本当ですか!?\r\nお侍さんが手伝ってくれれば百人力です！\r\n本当に……　ありがとうございます！",
  "Where's the next one going?": "で……　次はどこだ？",
  "North Umekojicho, to Yakichi-san.": "はい……\r\n梅小路町北の弥吉さんにお願いします。",
  "Yakichi in North Umekojicho. Got it.": "梅小路町北の弥吉、だな。\r\nわかった。",
  "Thank you again! You can keep the fee for this one too, of course.": "本当にありがとうございます。\r\n代金は前と同じように、御礼替わりとして\r\n貰っていただいて結構ですので。",
  "Well then, I'll be off too.": "では、私も配達に行きます！",
  "When you're finished, come back here and I'll find you another parcel.": "また届け終わりましたら、\r\n次の荷物をお渡ししますので、\r\nこちらに寄っていただければ、と。",
  "Thank you, kind samurai!": "それでは、よろしくお願いします！",
  "Kind samurai! Thanks for helping out.": "あ、お侍さん。\r\nいつもありがとうございます。",
  "It's all right. Any more deliveries to make?": "ああ。届ける荷物はあるか？",
  "Let's see, this delivery's going to, uhh...": "今回届けていただきたいのは、これです。\r\nえっと……",
  "North Fushimi Ichibangai...": "伏見一番街北の……",
  "Yashikimachi...": "屋敷町の……",
  "Sannocho...": "山王町の……",
  "Umekojicho...": "梅小路町の……",
  "Says by the riverside in Mukurogai...": "骸街、川辺の……",
  "Says the second floor of Mukurogai...": "骸街２階の……",
  "Kawaramachi in Rakunai...": "洛内、河原町の……",
  "It's marked for somewhere out front of Ginryu Dojo in Rakunai...": "洛内、吟柳道場前の……",
  "Please take it to Tome-san.": "トメさんへお願いします。",
  "Please take it to Ofuka-san.": "お深さんへお願いします。",
  "Please take it to Yoshiko-san.": "ヨシ子さんへお願いします。",
  "Please take it to Kimi-san.": "キミさんへお願いします。",
  "Please take it to Tae-san.": "妙さんへお願いします。",
  "Please take it to Hana-san.": "華さんへお願いします。",
  "Please take it to Sankichi-san.": "三吉さんへお願いします。",
  "Please take it to Keisuke-san.": "圭助さんへお願いします。",
  "Please take it to Gennosuke-san.": "源之助さんへお願いします。",
  "Please take it Hatsutaro-san.": "初太郎さんへお願いします。",
  "Please take it to Tsuguemon.": "継右衛門さんへお願いします。",
  "Please take it to Yunosuke-san.": "雄之助さんへお願いします。",
  "Please take it to Kyuzo-san.": "九蔵さんへお願いします。",
  "Please take it to Dansaburo-san.": "団三郎さんへお願いします。",
  "Please take it to Sadakichi-san.": "定吉さんへお願いします。",
  "Received <Color:8>Courier's Parcel<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>飛脚の荷物<Color:Default>」を預かった",
  "Thank you, and good luck.": "宜しくお願いしますね。",
  "Sorry, remind me who I'm taking this one to?": "すまない、\r\nどこの誰にとどけるんだったか、\r\n教えてもらえるか？",
  "In front of Ginryu Dojo in Rakunai...": "洛内の吟柳道場前にいる……",
  "Take it to Tome-san.": "トメさんへお願いします。",
  "Take it to Ofuka-san.": "お深さんへお願いします。",
  "Take it to Yoshiko-san.": "ヨシ子さんへお願いします。",
  "Take it to Kimi-san.": "キミさんへお願いします。",
  "Take it to Tae-san.": "妙さんへお願いします。",
  "Take it to Hana-san.": "華さんへお願いします。",
  "Take it to Sankichi-san.": "三吉さんへお願いします。",
  "Take it to Keisuke-san.": "圭助さんへお願いします。",
  "Take it to Gennosuke-san.": "源之助さんへお願いします。",
  "Take it to Hatsutaro-san.": "初太郎さんへお願いします。",
  "Take it to Tsuguemon.": "継右衛門さんへお願いします。",
  "Take it to Yunosuke-san.": "雄之助さんへお願いします。",
  "Take it to Kyuzo-san.": "九蔵さんへお願いします。",
  "Take it to Dansaburo-san.": "団三郎さんへお願いします。",
  "Take it to Sadakichi-san.": "定吉さんへお願いします。",
  "So, what's next?": "よう。今日は、届ける荷物はあるのか？",
  "Oh, kind samurai, we're all done for today! I took care of the rest myself!": "あ、お侍さん。\r\n実は、今日の分はもう終わっちゃいました。\r\nなんと自分だけで捌ききれたんです！",
  "No kidding? Good work.": "本当か……?!\r\n頑張ったじゃないか。",
  "It's all thanks to you. You've made so many deliveries for us, word-of-mouth has improved, and we're getting all the more jobs!": "ええ、最近あなたのおかげもあって、順調に\r\n捌けているので、評判が上がってきて、\r\n依頼も増えてきてるんです。商売繁盛ですよ！",
  "I'm glad to hear that. How's your father doing, by the way?": "それは良かったな。\r\n……だが、親父さんは大丈夫なのか？",
  "He's better, but it'll still be some time before he's back to work.": "はい、親父も大分良くなってきました。\r\n……でも、まだ仕事ができるようになるには\r\n時間がかかりそうなんです。",
  "So, I'm sorry to ask, but do you think you could keep helping me out? Just until Dad's on his feet again?": "あの……　申し訳ないんですが、\r\n親父が回復するまで、もうしばらく\r\n手伝ってはもらえないでしょうか？",
  "Well, we've come this far. I'll help when I can.": "まぁ、乗りかかった船だしな。\r\n今まで通り、ついでで良ければ、手を貸してやる。",
  "No problem. Take care, I'll come by again later.": "ああ。じゃあな。また来る。",
  "There'll be more work waiting for you then!": "はい！\r\n次来る頃には新しい仕事が入っていると思います。\r\nその時は、よろしくお願いしますね！",
  "Oh! Hello there!": "あ！　お侍さん！　どうも！",
  "Is that your father? I'm glad to see he's back on his feet.": "もしかして、そっちは親父さんか？\r\n病気が治ったみたいだな……　何よりだ。",
  "Yes! Dad, this is the man who's been kind enough to help me out.": "はいっ！\r\n親父、この人が俺を手伝ってくれていた人だよ。",
  "I've heard a lot about you. You've been a great help to my family.": "そうですか、あなたが……\r\n……この度は息子が世話になったようで。\r\n本当にありがとうございました。",
  "It wasn't much. Things have only gone so well because your son became a great courier when he had to.": "いや、俺は大したことはしていない。\r\n仕事が上手くいったのは、あんたの息子が\r\n立派な飛脚になったからだ。",
  "Aw, hell. If not for you, I might have had to give up entirely.": "そんなことありません。\r\nお侍さんが居なかったら私はもしかしたら、\r\n途中で逃げ出していたかもしれません。",
  "I can't thank you enough, kind samurai.": "本当に……　ありがとうございました！",
  "Hm. If you say so, but you're standing taller than you ever did before.": "ふっ。見違えるようにしっかり者になったな。",
  "Well said. My son really has grown up.": "ええ。……正直、息子がここまで成長するとは、\r\n思っていませんでした。",
  "As a matter of fact, I think he's ready to cover this whole area on his own.": "実はですね……　これからはその成長を見込んで、\r\nこの辺一帯を息子に任せてみようかと思うんです。",
  "Heh. Think you're up for it?": "ほう。……やれるのか？",
  "I'm nervous... but I'll do my best!": "ええ、まだ自信がないんですが……\r\nでもやってみたいんです！",
  "In that case, I'd appreciate it if you could still help him out, when you have the chance.": "ただ……　まだ私も少し不安でして。\r\nできればあなたに引き続き\r\n息子を手伝っていただきたいのです。",
  "Mm...": "ふむ……",
  "Of course, that's an official request from the head of our family business.": "もちろん、私から正式に\r\n依頼させていただくことになります。",
  "So, you can expect much better compensation. What do you say?": "なので、今までよりもお渡しする金額は\r\n多めにさせていただきます。\r\n……いかがでしょうか？",
  "All right, I could always use some extra coin. I'll pitch in.": "……分かった。\r\n良い小遣い稼ぎにもなりそうだしな。\r\n今まで通り、ついでで良ければ手伝おう。",
  "Really!? That's a relief!": "本当ですか!?\r\nあなたが手伝ってくれるのであれば、\r\n百人力です。",
  "You have my thanks, samurai.": "私からもお礼を言います。\r\nありがとうございます。",
  "With your help, I'm sure that someday I can become every bit the courier my father is. Thank you.": "いつか、父親を超える立派な飛脚になれるように、\r\n頑張っていきますので……\r\nこれからもよろしくお願いいたします。",
  "Are you Kankichi-san?": "あんたが勘吉さんか？",
  "That's me. Who are you?": "ああ、そうだが……\r\nアンタは？",
  "I'm filling in for the courier. Here, delivery for you.": "俺は飛脚代行だ。\r\nアンタ宛ての荷物を持ってきた。\r\n確認してくれ。",
  "Handed over <Color:8>Courier's Parcel<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>飛脚の荷物<Color:Default>」を渡した",
  "Ah, thanks for coming all this way.": "わざわざ届けてくれてありがとうなぁ。\r\nこれが代金だぁ。受け取ってくれ。",
  "Obtained <Color:8>5000 mon<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>５０００文<Color:Default>」をもらった",
  "(I should let the courier know I took care of it. We're meeting near Teradaya in Fushimi.)": "（一度飛脚のところへ戻るか\r\n　伏見の寺田屋の裏だったな）",
  "Are you Yakichi-san?": "あんたが弥吉さんか？",
  "Package for you.": "アンタ宛ての荷物を持ってきた。\r\n確認してくれ。",
  "Ah, there it is. Here's your fee.": "わざわざ届けてくれてありがとうなぁ。\r\nこれが代金だ。受け取ってくれ。",
  "Obtained <Color:8>6000 mon<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>６０００文<Color:Default>」をもらった",
  "Are you Tome-san?": "アンタがトメさんか？",
  "I have a package for you.": "アンタ宛ての荷物を持ってきた。\r\n確認してくれ。",
  "Thank you. Here's your payment.": "ありがとう。\r\nこれ代金です、受け取ってください。",
  "Are you Ofuka-san?": "アンタがお深さんか？",
  "Ah, great. And this is for you.": "ありがとう。\r\nこれ代金です、受け取ってください。",
  "Yoshiko-san?": "アンタがヨシ子さんか？",
  "Much appreciated. Here's your pay.": "ありがとう。\r\nこれ代金です、受け取ってください。",
  "Excuse me, Kimi-san?": "アンタがキミさんか？",
  "Hey, thanks. Here's the payment.": "ありがとう。\r\nこれ代金です、受け取ってください。",
  "Are you Tae-san?": "アンタが妙さんか？",
  "Excellent. Got your payment right here.": "ありがとう。\r\nこれ代金です、受け取ってください。",
  "Hana-san, right?": "アンタが華さんか？",
  "Right on time. Thanks so much.": "ありがとう。\r\nこれ代金です、受け取ってください。",
  "Are you Sankichi?": "アンタが三吉か？",
  "Excellent. Much obliged.": "ありがとう。\r\nこれ代金です、受け取ってください。",
  "You're Keisuke, right?": "アンタが圭助か？",
  "Hey, all right. And your pay.": "ありがとう。\r\nこれ代金です、受け取ってください。",
  "Are you Gennosuke?": "アンタが源之助か？",
  "Thanks a ton. This is for you.": "ありがとう。\r\nこれ代金です、受け取ってください。",
  "Hatsutaro, right?": "アンタが初太郎か？",
  "Fancy that. Here's your pay.": "ありがとう。\r\nこれ代金です、受け取ってください。",
  "Are you Tsuguemon?": "アンタが継右衛門か？",
  "Ah, I've been waiting. Thanks.": "ありがとう。\r\nこれ代金です、受け取ってください。",
  "Are you Yunosuke?": "アンタが雄之助か？",
  "Thank you. Right, here's your payment.": "ありがとう。\r\nこれ代金です、受け取ってください。",
  "You're Kyuzo, right?": "アンタが九蔵か？",
  "That's me. Much appreciated.": "ありがとう。\r\nこれ代金です、受け取ってください。",
  "Dansaburo?": "アンタが団三郎か？",
  "Thank you kindly. This is for you.": "ありがとう。\r\nこれ代金です、受け取ってください。",
  "Are you Sadakichi?": "アンタが定吉か？",
  "So you do! Many thanks.": "ありがとう。\r\nこれ代金です、受け取ってください。",
  "Obtained <Color:8>8000 mon<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>８０００文<Color:Default>」をもらった",
  "Obtained <Color:8>7000 mon<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>７０００文<Color:Default>」をもらった",
  "Obtained <Color:8>1 ryo<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>１両<Color:Default>」をもらった",
  "Obtained <Color:8>7500 mon<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>７５００文<Color:Default>」をもらった",
  "Obtained <Color:8>1 ryo and 2000 mon<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>１両２０００文<Color:Default>」をもらった",
  "Obtained <Color:8>1 ryo and 5000 mon<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>１両５０００文<Color:Default>」をもらった",
  "Obtained <Color:8>9000 mon<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>９０００文<Color:Default>」をもらった",
  "Guess that's it, then.": "ああ、確かに渡したぞ。",
  "Yo. I've got a Crimson Bead.": "……よぉ。\r\n「<Color:8>真紅の勾玉<Color:Default>」……だ。",
  "How about... twenty Water God Stones?": "「<Color:8>水神石<Color:Default>」２０個とだ。\r\n必要か……？",
  "Oh. Okay.": "そうか。",
  "I thought I said twenty Water God Stones. Maybe you didn't hear me.": "「<Color:8>水神石<Color:Default>」２０個は必要。\r\n……用意しろ。",
  "Obtained <Color:8>Crimson Bead<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>真紅の勾玉<Color:Default>」を貰った",
  "That's fine. Thank you.": "取引成立だ。\r\n……礼を言う、また来い。",
  "Hey. Nice to see you, Saito-san. If you're interested, I've got a Fine Horse's Mane.": "よぉ、俺なんかのところによく来たな……\r\nもの好きなお前に用意したのは「<Color:8>名馬の鬣<Color:Default>」だ。",
  "I'll trade it to you for a Pearl. 'Course, it's no big deal if you'd rather not.": "「<Color:8>真珠<Color:Default>」と交換しないか？\r\nいや、いらないなら別にいいけどよ……",
  "Haven't got a pearl on you? Okay, well, come back when you do.": "持っていないな……\r\nいらないってことか。\r\n必要になったら教えてくれ。",
  "Handed over <Color:8>Pearl<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>真珠<Color:Default>」を渡した",
  "Obtained <Color:8>Fine Horse's Mane<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>名馬の鬣<Color:Default>」を貰った",
  "Looks like we've got a deal! Thanks for taking the time to trade, even with a pushover like me.": "確かに貰った。\r\n俺なんかと取引してくれてありがとな。",
  "I've prepared five Wild Silks.": "……俺は「<Color:8>天蚕糸<Color:Default>」を５個用意した。",
  "I'll take a Pearl in return.": "……代わりに「<Color:8>真珠<Color:Default>」を持って来てくれ。",
  "Whatever.": "そうか、また来てくれ。",
  "Haven't got a pearl? Guess you'll have to find one.": "……持っていないな。\r\n…………真珠を用意してこい。",
  "Obtained <Color:8>Wild Silk<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>天蚕糸<Color:Default>」を貰った",
  "That'll do. I've got more Wild Silks, if you want.": "……確かに。\r\n「<Color:8>天蚕糸<Color:Default>」、まだある……\r\nまた来い。",
  "You the guy? I've got ten Beautiful Pelts on me.": "……俺が用意したのは「<Color:8>きれいな毛皮<Color:Default>」を１０枚だ。",
  "I'll let you have them for a Pearl.": "「<Color:8>真珠<Color:Default>」を持って来てくれたら交換してやろう。",
  "Hey, that's no pearl! Are you trying to swindle me!? I'm onto you, boss's friend or not!": "持ってないじゃないか！　お前、俺を騙そうとしたな!?\r\n次やったら、いくらお頭の友だとしても\r\n許さないからな！",
  "Obtained <Color:8>Beautiful Pelt<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>きれいな毛皮<Color:Default>」を貰った",
  "All right, deal's done. Now back away, slowly, and we'll be good.": "……ああ、確かに貰った。\r\nまた来てくれ。",
  "Yo! How are you doing today, Saito-san? I've got some Beast's Tail here! How about it? You want to trade with me? It's real good stuff!": "よお、よく来た！\r\n「<Color:8>獣の尻尾<Color:Default>」を用意した！\r\nどうだ？　欲しいだろ、欲しいよな？",
  "I'd love a Pearl for them! That sound good to you? My three Beast's Tail for a Pearl? That seems fair to me!": "「<Color:8>真珠<Color:Default>」を持って来てくれ！\r\nどうしても欲しいんだ、よろしく頼むぜ。\r\n「<Color:8>真珠<Color:Default>」と「<Color:8>獣の尻尾<Color:Default>」３つを交換だ。",
  "Okay! I mean, I'm disappointed, but maybe another time?": "そうか……　残念だけどしょうがないな！\r\nまた来てくれよ、待ってるからな。\r\n絶対だぞ！",
  "Guess you don't have any on you, huh? Well, if you come into a Pearl or two, you know where to find me! I'm always up for a good deal!": "なんだ、持っていないじゃないか。\r\nでも、持ってないならしょうがないよな！\r\n次来るときは絶対「<Color:8>真珠<Color:Default>」を用意してこいよ！",
  "Obtained <Color:8>Beast's Tail<Color:Default>.": "「<Color:8>獣の尻尾<Color:Default>」を貰った",
  "Hey, what fun that was! Thanks for the trade, Saito-san! I've still got some more if you find yourself with another Pearl!": "おお！　確かに貰ったぜ、ありがとな！\r\nまだまだ在庫はあるからよ、\r\nまた「<Color:8>真珠<Color:Default>」もってこいよ！　待ってるぜ！",
  "Hey there! Boss said to trade with you freely. I've got a Fine Silk Fabric, myself.": "やぁ、お頭から話は聞いてる。\r\n俺が用意したのは「<Color:8>綺麗な絹織物<Color:Default>」だ。",
  "I'm hoping for ten Water God Stones. How about that?": "「<Color:8>水神石<Color:Default>」を１０個用意して欲しい。\r\nどうだ、「<Color:8>綺麗な絹織物<Color:Default>」と交換するか？",
  "No problem! Let me know if you change your mind.": "そうか、また来てくれ。",
  "That doesn't seem to be enough. Come back with ten Water God Stones, would you?": "なんだ、持っていないのか。\r\n「<Color:8>水神石<Color:Default>」を１０個用意したらまた来てくれ。",
  "That seals the deal! Let me know if you'd like any more in the future.": "確かに貰ったよ、ありがとう。\r\nまた欲しくなったら言ってくれよ。",
  "Hmm. Something's happening at Shikokuya. I should hold off for now.": "なにやら、四国屋のほうが騒がしい様子……\r\nしばらくは様子を見た方がよいみたいですね。",
  "Heheh. Come back later. I'd like to avoid a mess.": "ヒヒ、またしばらくしたら来てくださいよ。\r\n巻き込まれるのは御免ですからね。",
  "I've been waiting for you. Are you ready to go?": "お待ちしてました。\r\nすぐ行けますか？",
  "(What should I do?)": "（どうするか……）",
  "Sorry, could you hold on a bit longer?": "すまない、もう少し待っててくれ。",
  "I suppose, but do hurry.": "分かりました。\r\nでも、なるべく急いでくださいね。",
  "So, you need an escort to the mansion near Shikokuya?": "四国屋の近くの屋敷前だったな。",
  "Yes. We'll head toward Shikokuya from here. You'll see it once we reach Rakunai.": "はい、あちらの通りから四国屋に向かってください。\r\n四国屋を通り過ぎて、洛内の大通りが\r\n見えたあたりにありますので。",
  "Right, got it.": "ああ、わかった。",
  "Saito-san, I've caused you far too much trouble. The Jozo Tengu will reform from here on—consider us an arm of the Tachibanagumi!": "斎藤さん、その節は迷惑かけたな。\r\n俺たち浄僧天狗は、心を入れ替えて\r\n橘組で真面目に働くことにした。",
  "I look forward to working with you, hahaha!": "これからはよろしくな。",
  "Thank you for all your help, Saito-san.": "斎藤さん、助けてくれてありがとな。",
  "The Touken Clan will be proud to serve the Tachibanagumi. Our cursed blades are at your disposal!": "俺たち刀剣一家は橘組に入ったよ。\r\nここなら安心して妖刀を探せるからな！",
  "Saito-san, thank you. Oharu, my sister, is doing well once again.": "斎藤さん、ありがとうございました。\r\n妹のお春も元気にやってます。",
  "If you or the Tachibanagumi ever need anything from me, it would be my honor.": "この恩は橘組に入って町の人を助けることで、\r\n返したいと思います。",
  "Y-You saved my life. Thank you.": "た、助けていただいて、\r\nありがとうございます。",
  "I'm just doing what's right.": "なんのことはない、\r\n無事でなによりだ。",
  "(Mission complete. I can head back to the barracks now.)": "（任務は片付いた、屯所へ戻るか？）",
  "Saito-san! It's Katsura! Katsura Kogoro's just down there!": "斎藤さん！　桂です！\r\n桂小五郎がこの先に！",
  "Took ya long enough. C'mon, let's move!": "遅かったやないか。\r\n上へあがるで！",
  "Captain Saito... Katsura has to be somewhere on this floor. Please... find him.": "斎藤隊長……\r\n桂はこの階のどこかに身を隠しているはずです……\r\nなんとか、探し出してください……",
  "Katsura is behind the sliding door... The one with the sakura storm painted on it. Please... take him down, Captain...": "桂は中庭近くの\r\n桜吹雪のふすまの奥にいるようです……\r\n後はよろしくお願いします……",
  "Th-Thank you for saving me.": "た、助けていただいて、\r\nありがとうございます。",
  "You're welcome, I'm just glad to see you safe.": "なんのことはない、\r\n無事でなによりだ。",
  "(Mission complete! Guess I can head back to the barracks now.)": "（任務は片付いた、屯所へ戻るか？）",
  "Th-Thank you so much for helping me.": "た、助けていただいて、\r\nありがとうございます。",
  "Don't worry about it, I just want to see you safe.": "なんのことはない、\r\n無事でなによりだ。",
  "Thank you, you're my hero!": "た、助けていただいて、\r\nありがとうございます。",
  "No need for that, just making sure you're safe.": "なんのことはない、\r\n無事でなによりだ。",
  "S-Saito-san... Katsura is... He's too much for us to handle...": "さ、斎藤さん……　奥に、桂が……\r\n俺たちじゃ手に負えません……",
  "Leave me! You have to catch him!": "早く、行ってやってください……！",
  "But don't feel any pressure to prove yourself. Your reputation has been excellent ever since you captured Izo.": "だが手柄をあせる必要はない。\r\n以蔵を捕えたことでお前の株は上がっている。",
  "Make sure to grab a bite before you go. I assume you have a favorite restaurant.": "襲撃までに腹ごしらえを済ませておけ。\r\nお前にも行きつけの店くらいあるだろう。",
  "I've got a favorite place myself. They have this unique cold noodle dish called reimen.": "私の行きつけでは変わった料理を出す。\r\n冷やした麺と書いて“冷麺”というんだが……",
  "It's not often forty shishi are in one place. That's a real opportunity for the Shinsengumi to make a name for itself.": "４０人の志士が一堂に会することは滅多にない。\r\n血は避けられまいが新選組の名を上げるいい機会だ。",
  "Be ready. You'll need plenty of stamina for this.": "体力勝負だ。\r\n準備を怠らんことだな。",
  "いて！": "いて！",
  "Way to go, Saito-san! You're the number one mahjong player in the entire city!": "すごいですね、ダンナ!!\r\nまさに京都一番の雀士ですよ！",
  "Buuut, that means you're gonna have to defend your title from here on.": "それじゃ、これからは\r\n順位表での防衛戦を戦うことになります。",
  "I have to play to keep my title?": "防衛戦？"
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "So, what's next?": "แล้วต่อไปคืออะไรล่ะ?",
  "Mm...": "อืม...",
  "Oh. Okay.": "อ๋อ โอเค",
  "Whatever.": "ช่างเถอะ",
  "(What should I do?)": "(ควรทำยังไงดีนะ)",
  "Right, got it.": "ได้เลย รับทราบ"
 }
}